  <p>Dear Faculty Members,</p>
  <p>The AICTE Training and Learning (ATAL) Academy is pleased to announce the schedule for the <strong>Faculty Development Programme (FDP) on Emerging Cyber Technologies & Blockchain Systems</strong> for the academic year 2026–2027.</p>
  <p>Institutions are invited to nominate up to two full-time teaching faculty members for each designated technical cohort. Applications must be submitted through the official AICTE portal before October 25, 2026.</p>
